thym 1

program entail-the-pshorts
  why: a fabulam entailed as three pshorts, for an expert, for a student and for everyone: guides to the proof,
       every run of sentences closed by the items it rests on.
  must: the Lean is never read here; nothing is built or run.
  decided 2026-11-22: a pshort is a guide to a formal proof and is never called a proof.

  takes f: fabula
  gives expert: short, student: short, everyone: short

  give expert: entail f as expert                  -- the logic, every spine lemma by its Lean name
  give student: entail f as student                -- the logic, each term defined at first use
  give everyone: entail f as everyone              -- the teaching order, the worked example, plain words
end
